WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.340
EMMA (VOICE NOTE): Hi Grandma, it's me! Just landed. I'll call you Sunday, okay? Love you.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.520
ASSISTANT: Hi, this is Ruth's call assistant. May I ask who's calling?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:22.280
CALLER: Hi! It's me, Emma, her granddaughter. Could you put Grandma on? It's kind of urgent.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.890
ASSISTANT: Of course. Just so I know it's you, what's the family's safe word?

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:33.020
CALLER: Oh, I... I can't remember. I just need the name of her bank, and the code they texted her.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.670
ASSISTANT: No problem. I'm checking with the family. One moment.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:44.320
ASSISTANT: I can't put this call through. I'll let the family know. Goodbye.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.930
EMMA: Hi Grandma, it's me.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.270
GRANDMA: Hello, sweetheart.
